            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H6006)",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-17",
            "actionTime": "16:32:39",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "At the conclusion of debate on H.R. 3616, the Chair put the question on passage of the bill and by voice vote announced the ayes had prevailed. Mr. Weber (TX) demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H35000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-17",
            "actionTime": "16:32:18",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-17",
            "actionTime": "15:59:54",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 3616.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-17",
            "actionTime": "15:58:39",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632 and H.R. 4371. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, under a structured rule and H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632, and H.R. 4371 under a closed rule. The resolution provides one motion to recommit on each bill.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H30000",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-17",
            "actionTime": "15:58:34",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 951. (consideration: CR H6000-6004)",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H1L210",
            "actionDate": "2025-12-16",
            "actionTime": "09:59:03",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 951 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632 and H.R. 4371. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 4776, under a structured rule and H.R. 1366, H.R. 845, H.R. 3616, H.R. 3632, and H.R. 4371 under a closed rule. The resolution provides one motion to recommit on each bill.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
